{"sections":[{"slug":"Geo-Sat-eq","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Geo-Sat-eq"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Satake <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">讲义</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何 Satake 等价"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"讲义"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> Gaitsgory <span lang=\"zh\">等人</span> 2010 <span lang=\"zh\">春季的几何表示论讨论班</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">网址</span>: https://people.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/gaitsgde/grad_2009/</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">分解</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于光滑曲线</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">分解</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>” (factorizable Grassmannian)\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为如下对象的模空间</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span> $T$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个点</span> $(x_i)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">允许相同</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">配备</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X \\setminus \\bigcup \\{x_i\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的平凡化</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对所有自然数</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">共同构成一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">还可以写成</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">相对环路群</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">相对弧群</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n} = G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n / G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})_n,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n$, $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">分别是如下对象的模空间</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个点</span> $(x_i)$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/去心形式圆盘","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">去心形式圆盘</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">值函数</span> $g\\in G(\\widehat {X}_{\\{x_i\\}}\\setminus \\{x_i\\})$;</li>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个点</span> $(x_i)$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式圆盘","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式圆盘</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">值函数</span> $g\\in G(\\widehat {X}_{\\{x_i\\}})$;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>$\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathrm{Gr}_G$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结构群为</span> $\\operatorname{Aut}(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">例如当</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身是小圆盘时</span>,\n$\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^1} = \\mathrm{Gr}_G\\times X$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Sph}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathrm{Gr}_{G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变</span> D-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Sph}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变</span> D-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">粗略地说</span>, $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$, $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的群结构导致这些范畴具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/卷积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">然而</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$ <span lang=\"zh\">比较野蛮</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们不能直接卷积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是利用等变性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">转移到较好的空间上作卷积</span>.</p>\n<p>$G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的乘法映射下降为映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Conv}_G = G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})\\times_{G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})}\\mathrm{Gr}_G \\overset{m}{\\to} \\mathrm{Gr}_G.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑映射</span> $\\mathrm{pr}\\colon \\mathrm{Conv}_G \\to \\mathrm{Gr}_G$, <span lang=\"zh\">先投影到第一分量</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$, <span lang=\"zh\">再投影到商</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K}) / G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O}) = \\mathrm{Gr}_G$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $F\\in\\mathsf{Sph}$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\widetilde F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathrm{pr}_2^*F$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K}) \\times G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$ <span lang=\"zh\">下降到</span> $\\mathrm{Conv}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $F_1,F_2\\in\\mathsf{Sph}$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nF_1 \\operatorname{\\widetilde {\\boxtimes}} F_2 = (\\mathrm{pr}^* F_1) \\otimes \\widetilde {F_2};\r\n$$\n$$\r\nF_1 * F_2 = m_* (F_1 \\operatorname{\\widetilde {\\boxtimes}} F_2).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">上述卷积使得</span> $\\mathsf{Sph}$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成刚性张量范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且存在忠实正合的纤维函子</span> $\\mathsf{Sph} \\to \\mathsf{Vect}$, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/淡中对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">淡中对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathsf{Sph}$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathsf{Rep}(^LG)$.</p>\n<p>$G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的群结构</span>\n$$\r\nm\\colon G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n \\times_{X^n} G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n \\to G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">下降为</span>\n$$\r\nm\\colon G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})_n \\times_{G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})_n} \\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n} \\to \\mathrm{Gr}_{G,X^n}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">群表示的分解范畴</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">为任意群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分解作用</span></strong> (factorizable action) <span lang=\"zh\">为如下数据</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的任意分划</span> $p \\colon n = n_1+\\cdots+ n_m$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $H^m$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $F|_{U_p}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用</span> ($U_p$ <span lang=\"zh\">是分划</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出的开子空间</span>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">特征层</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> <strong>Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">叠</span></strong> $\\mathcal H_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为如下对象的模空间</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的两个</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个点之外同构</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有两个投影映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Bun}_G \\overset{\\overleftarrow{h_n}}{\\longleftarrow} \\mathcal H_n \\overset{\\overrightarrow{h_n}}{\\longrightarrow} X^n\\times\\mathrm{Bun}_G,\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">范畴的结构</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $1 \\in \\mathrm{Gr}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $G(\\widehat {\\mathcal O})\\subset G(\\widehat {\\mathcal K})$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\delta_1 := 1_*\\mathbb{C}$. <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> $\\mathsf{Sph}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上卷积的单位</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $G \\hookleftarrow B \\twoheadrightarrow T$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出的图表</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Gr}_G \\overset{b}{\\leftarrow} \\mathrm{Gr}_B \\overset{t}{\\rightarrow} \\mathrm{Gr}_T,\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">我们将</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的商群而非子群</span>)\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nF = t_! b^*\\colon \\mathsf{Sph}\\to \\mathsf{Sph}_T \\simeq\\mathsf{Vect}^{X_*(T)}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">识别对偶群</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}